<title>GREECE: NATL MORTGAGE CUTS MORTGAGE RATE BY 15BPS.</title>
<headline>NATL MORTGAGE CUTS MORTGAGE RATE BY 15BPS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Mortgage Bank will drop the rate on its EKTE-Housing 1 15-year mortgage by 15 basis points to 11.75 from 11.90 percent, effective April 23, it said.</p>
<p>The rate is fixed for the first five years and then becomes floating, it said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
